<in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock contextRef="OneD">1. The financial results have been prepared in accordance with the Ind AS notified under the Companies (Indian Accounting Standards) Rules  n2015, as amended.  n2. The figures for the last quarter are the balancing figures between audited figures in respect of the full Financial Year and published year  nto date figures upto the third quarter of the respective year.  n3. Effective from April 1, 2018, the company has adopted Ind AS 115  Revenue from Contracts with Customers  using cumulative catch up  nmethod which is applied to contracts that are not completed as of April 1st 2018. The adoption of Ind AS 115 did not have any material  nimpact on the financial statements of the Company.  n4. Ministry of Corporate Affairs (MCA) has exempted the companies engaged in defence production from the requirement of Segment  nReporting.  n5. 'Earning per Share on the weighted average number equity shares outstanding.  n6. The Company has for the first time gone for public issue of shares during the year.  n7. The Board at its meeting held on 29th May 2019, recommended a dividend of Rs. 5.10/- per  nequity share (Face Value of Rs. 10/- per equity share) for the financial year 2018-19. This  ndividend is in addition to the interim dividend of Rs. 1.85/- per equity share paid for the  nfinancial year.  n8. In the previous quarter and year ended, the calculation of deferred tax contained error in  ncomputation of deferred tax assets. This error has been rectified with retrospective effect  nduring the current financial year by restating the previous year figures.  n9. As required under clause 33 of SEBI (Listing Obligation and Disclosure Requirements)  nRegulation, 2015, the Statutory Auditors of the Company have carried out an audit of the  nabove financial results for the quarter and year ended 31.03.2019.  n10. The above statement of financial results has been reviewed and recommended by the Audit  nCommittee and approved by the Board of Directors at their meeting held on 29th May 2019.  n11. Figures for the previous periods/ year have been regrouped/reclassified/rearranged wherever  nconsidered necessary to make them comparable with figures of the current year. </in-bse-fin:DisclosureOfNotesOnFinancialResultsExplanatoryTextBlock>
